  "body": "Fetch has a couple cases where it needs to check whether a stream is disturbed or locked. Is this something that other consumers of Streams need?\r\n\r\nFor Fetch's Body mixin I plan to introduce a term for this condition: \"unusable\" (see https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1155), but it would still be useful to have a term that's applicable to `ReadableStream` objects as well and ideally that name would be shared.",
